The spec of `root-core-globs-the-plugin-root-without-a-vault` with `root` dropped: the same
globs now resolve against a vault, and outside any project the run exits 2 instead of reaching
the plugin tree — `root: core` is what lifts the requirement.

-- fixtures/xdg/booping/config.yaml --
core:
  probe_playbook:
    queries:
      shipped_playbooks:
        glob:
          - playbooks/*/playbook.md
        where:
          name: groom
-- cmd --
booping query --config core.probe_playbook.queries.shipped_playbooks --output paths
-- exit --
2
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
error: no vault resolved — run inside a booping project or pass --project
